{"id":"649534","name":"酱萝卜","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649534/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"一根"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"100克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"120克"},{"name":"香醋","amount":"150克"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"五个"},{"name":"大蒜瓣","amount":"五个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜去皮，对半切开，两刀不切断，第三刀切断。","img":"images/649534/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入一大勺盐，还一勺白糖抓匀。","img":"images/649534/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腌制出水分，然后用清水清洗几遍。","img":"images/649534/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大碗里加入白糖。","img":"images/649534/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"生抽。","img":"images/649534/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香醋搅拌搅拌。","img":"images/649534/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入切片的大蒜。","img":"images/649534/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小米椒。","img":"images/649534/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入控水的萝卜。","img":"images/649534/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻拌均匀。","img":"images/649534/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"腌制半小时以上就可以食用。","img":"images/649534/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}